# Lab 02 Student Workspace

This folder is intentionally incomplete. Read the included `LAB_README.md`, `rubric.md`, `submission_checklist.md`, and `public_test_contract.md` before editing the `TODO(Lab 02)` area in `src/star_sprout_lab/model.py`.

## Supported setup

Verify that the selected interpreter is Python 3.11, 3.12, or 3.13 before creating an environment:

```bash
python --version
python -c "import sys; raise SystemExit(0 if (3, 11) <= sys.version_info[:2] < (3, 14) else 1)"
python -m venv .venv
```

Activate the environment:

```text
macOS/Linux: source .venv/bin/activate
PowerShell:   .venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
Conda:        conda create -n ncku-game-2026 python=3.11 -y
              conda activate ncku-game-2026
```

Then install and observe the baseline:

```bash
python -m pip install -e '.[test]'
python -m unittest discover -s tests_public -v
python -m star_sprout_lab --headless --seed 42 --frames 120 --assert-deterministic
```

If the package installer is unavailable, run the standard-library-only core directly with `PYTHONPATH=src` (macOS/Linux) or `$env:PYTHONPATH = "src"` (PowerShell), then use the same `python -m unittest` and headless commands.

The infrastructure tests are green; Lab 02 tests are expected to fail until you implement the published movement contract.
